detail-brush:
Detail Brush is a resource pack which brushes some detail into Minecraft items which might look poorly drawn or outdated, with the goal of bringing cohesion to the game's overall art style.

In short, this pack will do the following:
- Add a bit more detail to the shading and silhouette of certain items (for example: Minecarts and Doors);
- Redesign certain items (for example: Nether Wart, Bamboo, Soups, Blaze Rod and Music Discs);
- Introduce item sprites to specific items (for example: Mushrooms and Nether Fungi).

A full list of changes can be found in changelog.md , inside the .zip file, and a picture with all modified textures can be found at the Gallery.

